<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Admission Letter - <%= student.full_name %></title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        background: #eee;
        color: #000;
        font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
      }
      .no-print {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      .no-print button,
      .no-print a {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: #123468;
        color: #fff;
        font: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .no-print a {
        background: #555;
      }
      .a4 {
        width: 210mm;
        min-height: 297mm;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 8mm 10mm;
        background: #fff;
      }
      .letterhead {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }
      .references {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 3mm;
        margin: 1mm 0 5mm;
        font-size: 10.5pt;
      }
      .header {
        border-bottom: 2px solid #082858;
        padding-bottom: 1mm;
        margin-bottom: 5mm;
      }
      .student-details p {
        margin: 0;
      }
      .letter-body,
      .student-details {
        font-size: 11pt;
        line-height: 1.27;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 1mm 0 2mm;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13pt;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      h1 span {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 3mm;
      }
      .numbered {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 5mm 1fr;
        gap: 0;
        margin-bottom: 3mm;
      }
      .numbered p {
        margin: 0;
        text-align: justify;
      }
      .payment-note,
      .receipt-note {
        text-align: justify;
      }
      table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 2mm 0 1mm;
        font-size: 11pt;
      }
      th,
      td {
        border: 1px solid #000;
        padding: 1.5mm 1mm;
        text-align: left;
      }
      th {
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer {
        margin: 4mm 0 0 5mm;
        break-inside: avoid;
      }
      .footer img {
        display: block;
        width: 48mm;
        height: 10mm;
        object-fit: contain;
        object-position: left;
      }
      .footer p {
        margin: 0;
      }
      @page {
        size: A4 portrait;
        margin: 8mm 10mm;
      }
      @media print {
        html,
        body {
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
          background: #fff;
          print-color-adjust: exact;
          -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }
        .no-print {
          display: none !important;
        }
        .a4 {
          width: auto;
          height: auto;
          min-height: 0;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
        }
        .header,
        .student-details,
        h1,
        table,
        .footer {
          break-inside: avoid;
        }
        p {
          orphans: 3;
          widows: 3;
        }
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 820px) {
        body {
          padding: 10px;
        }
        .a4 {
          width: 100%;
          min-height: 0;
          padding: 5mm;
        }
        .references {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        table {
          font-size: 9pt;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="no-print">
      <button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print Letter</button>
      <a href="/student/dashboard">Back to Dashboard</a>
    </div>
    <main class="a4">
      <header class="header">
        <img
          class="letterhead"
          src="/css/images/admission-letterhead-2026.png"
          alt="Nsawkaw College of Education. Post Office Box NS 1, Nsawkaw, Tain District. Telephone: +233 (0) 507970090 / +233 (0) 595411080. Email: info@nsacoe.edu.gh. In case of reply the number and date of this letter should be quoted."
        />
        <div class="references">
          <span>OUR REF: <strong>NSCE/5ADMS/V.5/01</strong></span>
          <span>YOUR REF: ……………………</span>
          <span><strong>DATE: <%= admissionDate %></strong></span>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="student-details">
        <p>NAME: <strong><%= student.full_name %></strong></p>
        <p>ADMISSION NO: <strong><%= student.admission_number %></strong></p>
        <p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>
      </div>
      <section class="letter-body">
        <h1>
          OFFER OF ADMISSION<br /><span><%= academicYear %> ACADEMIC YEAR</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="numbered">
          <span>1.</span>
          <p>
            You have been admitted at Nsawkaw College of Education to pursue a
            4-year Bachelor’s degree programme leading to the award of B.ED
            PRIMARY EDUCATION from the University of Cape Coast (UCC). You are
            to report on campus for the
            <strong><%= academicYear %></strong> academic year on
            <strong><%= reportingDate %> before <%= reportingTime %>.</strong>
            Students who report after <%= reportingTime %> would not be
            entertained.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="numbered">
          <span>2.</span>
          <p>
            Your admission is for the
            <strong><%= academicYear %></strong> academic year only. If you fail
            to enroll or withdraw from the programme without prior approval from
            the college authorities, you will forfeit the admission and the fees
            automatically.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="numbered">
          <span>3.</span>
          <p>
            The total fee for the <strong>first semester</strong> of
            <strong><%= academicYear %></strong> academic calendar is Five
            Thousand, Four Hundred and eighty Ghana Cedis
            <strong>(GH¢ 5,480.00)</strong> including feeding, accommodation,
            facility user fee, tuition fee, and examination fee for
            <strong>the 1st semester.</strong> To <strong>secure</strong> your
            place in the College, make
            <strong>full non-refundable payment</strong> of the fees on or
            before <strong> 18th October, 2026.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="payment-note">
          <strong>Note</strong> that the College will not accept physical cash.
          <em
            >Therefore, you are to pay your fees upon receipt of this admission
            letter at any of the branches of the banks indicated below
            throughout the country.</em
          >
        </p>
        <table aria-label="Banks for admission fee payment">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>NO.</th>
              <th>BANK</th>
              <th>ACCOUNT NUMBER</th>
              <th>BRANCH</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>1</td>
              <td>BACCSOD</td>
              <td>2071481008529201</td>
              <td>Nsawkaw/Banda</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2</td>
              <td>GCB</td>
              <td>7111130001820</td>
              <td>Wenchi</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>3</td>
              <td>CBG</td>
              <td>2216537640001</td>
              <td>Techiman–Wenchi Road</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="receipt-note">
          A snapshot of your bank payment receipt(s) should be sent via WhatsApp
          to <strong>0597671371 and 0263742044.</strong> On arrival, the
          original payment receipt from the bank, a copy of your admission
          letter, acceptance form and results slip/certificate must be SUBMITTED
          IMMEDIATELY TO THE FINANCE OFFICE of the College.
        </p>
        <div class="numbered">
          <span>4.</span>
          <p>
            Your WASSCE result(s) shall be verified at WAEC and if any
            discrepancies are detected in your results and/or identity, you will
            be dismissed instantly from the College without prejudice to any
            legal action that may be taken against you.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="numbered">
          <span>5.</span>
          <p>Congratulations on your admission, please.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          <img src="/css/images/signature.png" alt="Principal Signature" />
          <p>Prof. Augustine Oppon-Kumi<br />(College Principal)</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
